    {
      "name": "Cabinet of Curiosities",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>The workshop's shelves, cupboards, and tables are cluttered with macabre bric-a-brac, including body parts in jars of formaldehyde and bloody surgical implements. Once per scene, a PC can make an Instinct Roll to look for something useful in the chaos.</p><section id=\"secret-Fs21TFNgkDCks2NO\" class=\"secret\"><p>What was the alchemist studying? What smell overwhelms you as you shuffl e through their things?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
